{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-90","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：截差无理线段","englishTitle":"To find the sixth apotome.","book":10,"number":90,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.90","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.90/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":90,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","contentId":"euclid-10-90","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c94b9a6fb060f2fe934ff3ae3f871e7c0e5a913976f65ce2588d7a85772cfc0e","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-90.statement","euclid-10-90.construction.1","euclid-10-90.construction.2","euclid-10-90.proof.1","euclid-10-90.proof.2","euclid-10-90.proof.3","euclid-10-90.proof.4","euclid-10-90.proof.5","euclid-10-90.proof.6","euclid-10-90.proof.7","euclid-10-90.proof.8","euclid-10-90.proof.9","euclid-10-90.proof.10","euclid-10-90.proof.11","euclid-10-90.proof.12","euclid-10-90.proof.13","euclid-10-90.proof.14","euclid-10-90.proof.15","euclid-10-90.proof.16","euclid-10-90.conclusion","euclid-10-90.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-90.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ec897afb31401cc4a5f120ccc2bb99cb47a4bd496573120f9a02a10ddb650461","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find the sixth apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找第六截差无理线段"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"85da2ffe2bc5736511b68aa445ab2aa833519b65ee39a0f2b892a751aeae6b55","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a rational straight line A be set out, and three numbers E, BC, CD not having to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number; and further let CB also not have to BD the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出有理线段 A,3个数字,E,BC,CD,不需彼此对应平方数至平方数的比;又让CB不必与平方数至平方数的比BD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7ccb660f560017574ef2871f6fbf90bb2366eb37124d1307bcca5d163b5fa8bc","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be contrived that, as E is to BC, so is the square on A to the square on FG, and, as BC is to CD, so is the square on FG to the square on GH. [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设E比BC等于A比正方形比FG比正方形,BC比CD等于正方形比正方形比GH比正方形 [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"443c2d1a03b3d92562883af8a73dce6a99068d5959fdc0d8103f70d0f569dbf3","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now since, as E is to BC, so is the square on A to the square on FG, therefore the square on A is commensurable with the square on FG. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从此以后,E比BC等于A比正方形,FG比正方形,因此,A比正方形等于可公度,FG比正方形 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"48981e6d95c671f258fbc1e1debe826f1715d1227f849b88df9d5222199114f8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on A is rational; therefore the square on FG is also rational; therefore FG is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A的正方形是有理;FG的正方形也是有理;FG也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4855eb884ac4bead1fb9c9bdf84ea90947cd615501dd9bd54a83967d52fa28aa","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since E has not to BC the ratio which a square number has to a square number, therefore neither has the square on A to the square on FG the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore A is incommensurable in length with FG. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于E的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数,BC的比例为平方数,FG的比例为正方形,正方形的比例为正方形,FG的比例为平方数,A的比例为不可公度,FG的比例为不可公度。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"947545009dbd37fb75b1653fb7b472182f3ea4010c1f1d6e17ad9f7298150e2b","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since, as BC is to CD, so is the square on FG to the square on GH, therefore the square on FG is commensurable with the square on GH. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,BC比CD等于FG比正方形,GH比正方形,因此,FG比正方形等于可公度,GH比正方形 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c0318aa1f4be04306ce4ff939c23e3bbc6c967588e98c623c1be88dd6e5dc166","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on FG is rational; therefore the square on GH is also rational; therefore GH is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但FG的正方形是有理;GH的正方形也是有理;GH也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b7b8779b158064c20aed9bde4778b400515ac6d68de838d5ce683edb57c2738f","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since BC has not to CD the ratio which a square number has to a square number, therefore neither has the square on FG to the square on GH the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore FG is incommensurable in length with GH. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于BC的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数,CD的比例为平方数,GH的比例为正方形,正方形的比例为正方形,GH的比例为平方数,FG的比例为不可公度,GH的比例为不可公度。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"11f94dc719987fb814226b450b06e2e86e9d692457ed6fa305cd5902af0f8040","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And both are rational; therefore FG, GH are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore FH is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两者均为有理;因此,FG,GH是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,FH是截差无理线段。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"89017e8e1c1fcd989d2330cc23e56f11b4f6c2b47be9ff24511f271459035b40","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also a sixth apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是第六个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ebb3e9a35f00480b8117b5211274b073e0928bc6031c32dbbd654d9bff172b67","citations":["euclid-5-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as E is to BC, so is the square on A to the square on FG, and, as BC is to CD, so is the square on FG to the square on GH, therefore, ex aequali, as E is to CD, so is the square on A to the square on GH. [[v. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"E比BC,相当于A比正方形,FG比正方形,CD比正方形,因此,从平等角度看,E比GH比正方形,A比正方形 [[v. 22](/principles/euclid-5-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ffe4b4e8150a890ab707e07dde461caed476c028894c9c205847952e53c08921","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But E has not to CD the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore neither has the square on A to the square on GH the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore A is incommensurable in length with GH; [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)] therefore neither of the straight lines FG, GH is commensurable in length with the rational straight line A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,E的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数;因此,GH的比例为正方形,A的比例为平方数,而正方形的比例为平方数;因此,A的比例为不可公度,GH的比例为GH;因此,直线的FG和直线的CD的比例均不到长度可公度,有理线段的比例为A。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c2decf6a5ac48c7e4116f6afaeace2ec17b617076810664e220a821fb9ad2fa7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now let the square on K be that by which the square on FG is greater than the square on GH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,K正方形,就是FG正方形比GH正方形大"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"359d757038ca9511989eb4dcfd9cf2c81e4a5dd3970b5861d2418883845598a3","citations":["euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then, as BC is to CD, so is the square on FG to the square on GH, therefore, convertendo, as CB is to BD, so is the square on FG to the square on K. [[v. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,BC比CD等于FG比正方形,GH比正方形,因此,转换率为CB比BD等于FG比正方形比比正方形（相关点与线段：K） [[v. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1f5cc159159614c8c1327a81d89adbed95916610d7d5b982e1105fb1e9655dae","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CB has not to BD the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore neither has the square on FG to the square on K the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore FG is incommensurable in length with K. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CB的比例为平方数,而平方数的比例为平方数;因此,K的比例为正方形,而FG的比例为正方形,而K的比例为平方数;因此,FG的比例为不可公度,而K的比例为不可公度。（相关点与线段：BD） [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ae0f8a1de0869e31ab69ac5264c3fffe3b81d9c34affdac281982e898c805cf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the square on FG is greater than the square on GH by the square on K; therefore the square on FG is greater than the square on GH by the square on a straight line incommensurable in length with FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FG线上的正方形比GH线上的正方形比K线上的正方形要高,因此,FG线上的正方形比GH线上的正方形比不可公度上的不可公度长,FG线上正方形上正方形比正方形还要高。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"72776c1dc8cd5b03d0bc29d3d59c18740116585e96435b3dac7adddf2b7ff621","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And neither of the straight lines FG, GH is commensurable with the rational straight line A set out."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FG,GH线中没有一个是可公度线 有理线段,A线已经布置"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"61ae6463682bb764d55c186c22253ff328e9f65d538a6770e379eaf0112b4c11","citations":["euclid-10-def-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore FH is a sixth apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 6](/principles/euclid-10-def-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所以FH是第六截差无理线段 [[X. Deff. III. 6](/principles/euclid-10-def-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":19,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"24dd2ef73eb75d51443d878ddf9b0ce783543dd336d2aad7a2eb540c0ca489e3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the sixth apotome FH has been found. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,已发现第六批截差无理线段,FH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-90.source","contentId":"euclid-10-90","revisionId":"euclid-10-90@raw-c94b9a6fb060f2fe","order":20,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"abc22730b67e17b4a84e6b68fa5451def6b67db7340f7b0e9ca8e6f5072d1020","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.90/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.90\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-90:euclid-10-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-90","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-90.construction.2","euclid-10-90.proof.1","euclid-10-90.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.90","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.90/","sourceLabel":"X. 6, Por."}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-90:euclid-10-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-90","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-90.proof.3","euclid-10-90.proof.6","euclid-10-90.proof.10","euclid-10-90.proof.13"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-9","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.90","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.90/","sourceLabel":"X. 9"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-90:euclid-10-73:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-90","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-90.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-73","type":"depends_o